Subject: [PATCH] proxy: avoid setpgid in the render server child

QEMU with elevateprivileges=deny blocks setpgid. Skip this call so the
render server can start under the local libvirt sandbox. This workaround
leaves the child in the existing process group.

diff --git a/src/proxy/proxy_server.c b/src/proxy/proxy_server.c
--- a/src/proxy/proxy_server.c
+++ b/src/proxy/proxy_server.c
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
       close(client_fd);
 
       /* do not receive signals from terminal */
-      setpgid(0, 0);
+      /* libvirt seccomp denies setpgid. */
 
       char fd_str[16];
       snprintf(fd_str, sizeof(fd_str), "%d", remote_fd);
